{"parse": {"title": "衣着/周末探险小队", "pageid": 55574, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"character-skin-page\"><div class=\"character-base-info\"><div class=\"character-img-box0 tabber\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div class=\"character-img-box1\"><div class=\"tabber-item hide-m\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"Skin_bg-300604.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit-height\" style=\"position:absolute; right:0; height:100%;display:none;\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2\"><img alt=\"Zhujiemian you di.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bc/Zhujiemian_you_di.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"508\" height=\"612\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" data-file-width=\"508\" data-file-height=\"612\" /></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-id=\"300604\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-tabberimg=\"Portrait-300604.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:Portrait-300604.webp\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"L2d_static-300604_xcqe_p.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:L2d_static-300604_xcqe_p.webp\" style=\"display:none;\"></div></div><div class=\"character-desc-offset\"><div class=\"character-img-button-group\"><div class=\"tabber-filter l2d-button-group\"><div class=\"l2d-button\"><img alt=\"Btm lihui.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4d/Btm_lihui.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"84\" data-file-height=\"84\" /></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"0\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-type=\"isl2d\">L2D</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-type=\"isl2d\">立绘</div></div></div></div><div class=\"img-desc img-desc-only\" style=\"position:relative; padding-bottom:25px\">搭棚、扎营、煎鸡蛋，童子军受到的训练当然包括它们。</div><div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-300604 xcqe.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/05/Spine_static-300604_xcqe.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"193\" height=\"445\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"193\" data-file-height=\"445\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3006\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%98%A5%E9%9B%80%E5%84%BF\" title=\"小春雀儿\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%98%A5%E9%9B%80%E5%84%BF\" title=\"小春雀儿\"><img alt=\"小春雀儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-300601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%98%A5%E9%9B%80%E5%84%BF\" title=\"小春雀儿\">小春雀儿</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.9</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>多焦点舞台</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：300604</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">以《童子军手册》的标准来看，这应该是一次状况频出、相当失败的行动吧？<br />巧克力威化饼干非常好吃，但作为单兵口粮显然不够防潮。烧烤架作为热食制备工具效率很高，可冒出的烟雾会暴露位置。充当运载工具的拉普拉斯露营车堪称完美，但车主的改装降低了稳定性，司机的车技也不尽如人意。<br />明明已经脱离正轨，队员们却仍然轻快地继续行动——没有及时固定的野餐垫被风吹起，引得苏芙比抛下了大小姐的矜持跑着去追；烧烤架的烟雾飘得到处都是，反倒成了X测试自制鼓风机的理由。<br />当然，行动的困难，敌不过优秀的团队合作，小春雀儿最终协助伙伴们解决了所有麻烦。只不过，当营火升起时，她脸上那明媚的笑容，或许也不仅仅因为这些吧？</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"300604\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300607.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/37/Belonging-300607.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">郊野的雏菊<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Wild Daisies</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一束高约32.5厘米的雏菊花束，普通，简洁，大自然的馈赠。<br />花束根部被受访者紧紧扎起，花枝高低错落，辅以小巧的斯太菊及尤加利叶，颇具灵性。很难想象这是年纪较小的受访者自己搭配的杰作。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300608.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/89/Belonging-300608.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">遮阳伞<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Parasol</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.9<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一把独具出品厂商特色的遮阳伞。蓝白相间的底纹，长柄的设计较为复古，便于拿举与支撑。<br />不使用时，受访者会仔细将伞页沿着折痕折好并认真扣起搭扣。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300609.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/20/Belonging-300609.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“雀跃的心”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Jovial Heart\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.02<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>双色磨砂漆面钛制发夹，购置于某家无名的二手饰品店，极具童趣的设计。<br />“它没什么特别的，只是……亮晶晶的。”受访者平静地回答了这一问题，之后，她又小心翼翼地将它戴回了原来的位置。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">周末探险小队 <small style=\"color: grey\">Weekend Excursion</small></span></span>"}}